-- title:
--   Original stopped compact C1 nonlinear jump source equals intrinsic marked jump-time grid sum of either signed part
-- statement:
--   The actual admissible original Lévy/dividend process has a measurable discounted nonlinear C1 left-reserve negative-mark kernel. For each real sign multiplier, its intrinsic nonnegative marked integral through the exact ruin/horizon stopped grid equals the finite sum of actual jump-time tsums on each physical cell, including contact and excluding time zero, without extra stochastic measurability premises.

